# Product shape

Benedict is a Slack app. Invite the bot, connect a repo, that channel has a brain.

- One independent agent per onboarded repo. Its job is to **maintain that repo**.
- Isolate memory, index, and actions per repo. Do not build a workspace-wide general assistant.
- MCP in the IDE is the same product and the same memory. Not a second SKU, index, or name.
- Price by Slack workspace or by onboarded repo. Do not propose seat-based pricing.
- Stay local-folder-first. Do not clone from GitHub for the customer. That is why enterprise can run the same agent in their VPC.
- The architect channel is the only cross-project exception.

The decision record is `docs/adr/0004-product-shape.md`.
